+/* SEO conversion pages (.hero.seo-top) use long, dynamic titles like
+   "Attonewton Meters to Piconewton Meters Converter" that are far
+   longer than the homepage's fixed marketing headline - this overrides
+   just the SEO-page H1 to a smaller size with a slightly looser
+   line-height so wrapped lines stay readable, without touching the
+   homepage's .hero h1 above (same selector specificity, so source
+   order after the base rule is what makes this win only where the
+   .seo-top class is also present). */
+.seo-top h1 {
